### ================================================================
### Akatsuki's Draft — HTTP Requests Collection
### VS Code REST Client (humao.rest-client)
### ================================================================
### Usage: Install the "REST Client" extension in VS Code.
###        Click "Send Request" above each block.
###        Update @token and @adminToken after logging in.
### ================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### --- Variables (update after login) ---
@token = YOUR_USER_TOKEN_HERE
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@postId = YOUR_POST_ID_HERE
@pendingPostId = YOUR_PENDING_POST_ID_HERE

### ================================================================
### HEALTH CHECK
### ================================================================

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ================================================================
### AUTHENTICATION
### ================================================================

### Register a regular user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Naruto Uzumaki",
  "email": "naruto@konoha.dev",
  "password": "ramen123"
}

### Register an admin user (only works when ALLOW_ADMIN_SIGNUP=true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pain Leader",
  "email": "pain@akatsuki.dev",
  "password": "admin123",
  "role": "admin"
}

### ❌ Register — duplicate email (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Naruto Clone",
  "email": "naruto@konoha.dev",
  "password": "shadow123"
}

### ❌ Register — missing fields (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody@test.dev"
}

### ❌ Register — short password (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Short Pass",
  "email": "short@test.dev",
  "password": "123"
}

### Login as regular user
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "naruto@konoha.dev",
  "password": "ramen123"
}

### Login as admin (seeded or registered)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@akatsuki.dev",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### ❌ Login — wrong password (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "naruto@konoha.dev",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### ❌ Login — non-existent user (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody@void.dev",
  "password": "doesntmatter"
}

### Get current user profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ❌ Get me — no token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### ❌ Get me — invalid token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.here

### ================================================================
### POSTS (User)
### ================================================================

### Create a post (draft — default)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Understanding Chakra Control",
  "description": "A guide to mastering chakra",
  "content": "Chakra control is the ability to extract and release chakra from every tenketsu in one's body. This is an essential skill for all shinobi. In this article we explore the fundamentals of chakra control including tree walking, water walking, and advanced medical ninjutsu applications.",
  "category": "ninjutsu",
  "image": "https://example.com/chakra.jpg"
}

### Create a post (set to pending)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "The History of the Hidden Leaf",
  "content": "Konohagakure was founded by Hashirama Senju and Madara Uchiha. The village has a rich history spanning many generations of powerful shinobi.",
  "category": "history",
  "status": "pending"
}

### ❌ Create post — invalid status (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Trying to sneak approved",
  "content": "Should fail",
  "status": "approved"
}

### ❌ Create post — no auth (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "No Auth Post",
  "content": "This should fail"
}

### ❌ Create post — missing title (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "content": "No title provided"
}

### Get all approved posts (public — no auth needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts

### Get approved posts with pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?page=1&limit=5

### Get approved posts filtered by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?category=ninjutsu

### Search approved posts by title
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?search=chakra

### Combined: search + category + pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts?search=history&category=history&page=1&limit=10

### Get my posts (all statuses)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/my-posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ❌ Get my posts — no auth (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/my-posts

### Get a single approved post by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}

### ❌ Get post — invalid ID format (400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/not-a-valid-id

### ❌ Get post — valid ObjectId but doesn't exist (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011

### ❌ Get post — exists but not approved (404)
### (Use a draft/pending post ID here)
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}

### Update own post
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Understanding Chakra Control — Updated",
  "content": "Updated content with more details about chakra nature transformation.",
  "status": "pending"
}

### ❌ Update post — not owner (403)
### (Use the admin token to try updating a user's post)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "title": "Admin trying to edit user's post"
}

### ❌ Update post — try to set status to "approved" (400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "status": "approved"
}

### Delete own post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ❌ Delete post — not owner (403)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ================================================================
### ADMIN
### ================================================================

### Get all pending posts (admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/posts/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ❌ Get pending posts — non-admin user (403)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/posts/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ❌ Get pending posts — no auth (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/posts/pending

### Approve a pending post
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/posts/approve/{{pendingPostId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ❌ Approve — not a pending post (400)
### (Use an already approved or draft post ID)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/posts/approve/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reject a pending post (with reason)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/posts/reject/{{pendingPostId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "reason": "Content does not meet our quality guidelines. Please revise and resubmit."
}

### Reject a pending post (without reason)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/posts/reject/{{pendingPostId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ❌ Reject — not a pending post (400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/posts/reject/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ❌ Admin routes — user tries to approve (403)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/posts/approve/{{pendingPostId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ================================================================
### AI IMPROVEMENT
### ================================================================

### Improve own post with AI
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/improve/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ❌ Improve — not owner (403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/improve/{{postId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ❌ Improve — invalid ID (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/improve/not-a-valid-id
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ❌ Improve — post doesn't exist (404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/improve/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ❌ Improve — no auth (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/ai/improve/{{postId}}

### ================================================================
### UNKNOWN ROUTE (404)
### ================================================================

### ❌ Unknown route (404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/some/unknown/route
